...@_style

cells: "The agent cursor: Jev decides what to circle, live" {
  class: grid
  grid-rows: 1
  grid-columns: 4
  horizontal-gap: 220

  agent: |md
    ### GPT-Live speaks
    - "...channel **TikTok**,"
    - "segment **Women 25 to 34**..."
  | {class: [card; reasoning]; width: 330}

  jev: |md
    ### Jev judges every fragment
    - the last six words
    - which control named last
    - ~0.3 s · how sure
  | {class: [card; reasoning]; width: 330}

  sdk: |md
    ### Browser SDK
    - live registry of controls,
    - chart points, rows, reviews
  | {class: [card; observation]; width: 330}

  extension: |md
    ### Chrome extension
    - cursor glides over
    - **circles** the exact control
  | {class: [card; runtime]; width: 330}
}

cells.agent -> cells.jev: each fragment {class: edge}
cells.jev -> cells.sdk: resolve target {class: edge-dashed}
cells.sdk -> cells.extension: confident: circle {class: edge-ok}
